{0 ocgdkpixbuf}

The {b ocgdkpixbuf} package provides OCaml bindings for GdkPixbuf: image
loading, scaling and pixel-buffer manipulation. They are generated from
GdkPixbuf's GObject introspection data.

{%html:<a href="../ocgtk/conventions.html">The conventions page</a>%} explains how the bindings are organised and how GObject maps onto OCaml.

{1 Modules}

The library is reached as {!Ocgdkpixbuf}, with one module per class, interface or
record, such as {!Ocgdkpixbuf.Pixbuf} and {!Ocgdkpixbuf.Pixbuf_loader}.

{b {{!page-modules}All classes and records}}

{ul
{- {!Ocgdkpixbuf.Enums} — enumerations and bitfields. }
{- {!Ocgdkpixbuf.Constants} — constants. }
{- {!Ocgdkpixbuf.Raw} — the C externals and abstract types the modules above are
   built on. }
}

{1 Dependencies}

It builds on {!Ocglib} (GLib and GObject) and {!Ocgio}.
